%% AMO unit FSM. Minimal text.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE
  IDLE --> AMO_READ : LR / AMO start
  IDLE --> AMO_WRITE : SC, reservation ok
  IDLE --> DONE : SC, reservation fail (result=1)
  AMO_READ --> DONE : LR done (result = old value)
  AMO_READ --> AMO_WRITE : AMO, got old value
  AMO_WRITE --> DONE : write accepted
  DONE --> IDLE : result captured by IE
